sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Source App
    participant OS as macOS Network Stack
    participant Filter as Filter Provider
    participant Proxy as Transparent Proxy
    participant Upstream as Target/Proxy

    App->>OS: open socket
    OS->>Filter: handleNewFlow(metadata)
    Filter->>Filter: immutable rule lookup
    alt firewall block
        Filter-->>OS: drop verdict
        OS-->>App: connection failure
    else allow
        Filter-->>OS: allow + stats frequency
        opt selective proxy enabled and candidate flow
            OS->>Proxy: handleNewFlow(flow)
            Proxy->>Proxy: route lookup + recursion guard
            alt direct
                Proxy-->>OS: false
                OS->>Upstream: normal connection
            else proxy
                Proxy-->>OS: true
                Proxy->>Upstream: NWConnection + handshake
                Proxy->>App: open provider flow
                App<<->>Proxy: bounded relay
                Proxy<<->>Upstream: bounded relay
            end
        end
        OS-->>Filter: statistics reports
        Filter->>Filter: cumulative-to-delta + bucket aggregate
    end
